        "_type": "sectionHeading",
        "subtitle": "The California Common Core State Standards are taught by highly qualified international teachers who accommodate the diverse learning needs of all students, foster critical thinking, strengthen UAE National Identity and prepare students to become globally competent, confident and responsible citizens who value their national heritage while embracing global perspectives.",
        "title": "American Curriculum, UAE Heart."
