              "_type": "block",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "c07b638746fa",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "marks": [],
                  "text": "Students benefit from well-equipped facilities, hands-on learning experiences, and access to Advanced Placement (AP) courses, STEM and robotics initiatives, and extracurricular activities that nurture their talents and critical thinking skills."
                }
              ],
